{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d5cc3938f81e6973","name":"Sharpshooter Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-d5cc3938f81e6973","title":"Sharpshooter Talent Tree","revision":20943,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:51:06Z","sha256":"04f22ba6d0118644ed0f8f105e920e16f82c84e9509409c782aa4c2b5db38cf4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20943","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sharpshooter%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d5cc3938f81e6973","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are an expert at long-range combat, using the inherent advantage of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," to win the day.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Precision Shot"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Far Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Far_Shot","referenceId":"reference:3f8c140a30e5083f"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," Action, you gain the benefit of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Point-Blank Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Point-Blank_Shot","referenceId":"reference:7464dcbe8125c639"}," feat against your target, regardless of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," category.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Bullseye"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Draw a Bead"]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Precision Shot"]},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sniper"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sniper","referenceId":"reference:3d46249e7981482f"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, you can designate a single target that you have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aimed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aimed"}," at and is not within Point-Blank ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". When making a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," roll against that target, the target is denied its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," when determining the effect of your attack.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Draw a Bead"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," +10, ",{"tag":"b","children":["Precision Shot"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per round, you can spend a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to designate a single enemy who is not within Point-Blank ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". When you make a successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," roll that deals damage against the designated enemy, add your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus (minimum +1) to the damage roll. This effect lasts until the target is unconscious, dead, or leaves your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". You can have only one enemy designated in this manner.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Pinning Shot"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Precision Shot"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can keep your target worrying about where the next shot is coming from instead of trying to flee. When you deal damage to an enemy that you have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aimed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aimed"}," at, the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," is reduced to 2 squares, and the target cannot take either a double ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," Action or use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Run"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Run","referenceId":"reference:00d60e31a4e6b834"}," Action until the end of your next turn. This is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stunning"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stunning"}," effect.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Harrying Shot"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Pinning Shot"]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Precision Shot"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you make a successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against an enemy that you have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aimed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aimed"}," at and the attack deals damage, the target cannot use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," to make an attack roll on his or her next turn. This is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stunning"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stunning"}," effect.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
